          "Can complete a targeted remediation cycle and use reassessment evidence to advance or reteach.",
          "Can hear /n/ initially and finally, distinguish it from /m/, and connect it to n.",
          "Can decode taught CVC words containing n in initial or final position.",
          "Can segment and spell taught CVC words containing n, including initial and final n.",
