          "Can remediate a diagnosed short-/e/ weakness and demonstrate readiness on fresh reassessment items.",
          "Can hear and identify short /u/ and connect the phoneme to grapheme u in controlled CVC words.",
          "Can decode taught short-/u/ CVC words by accurate grapheme-to-phoneme mapping and blending.",
          "Can segment and encode taught short-/u/ CVC words using accurate sound-to-letter mapping.",
